# Environment Setup

## Overview

This section documents the configuration of the cloud-based threat hunting environment using Microsoft Azure.

## Infrastructure Configuration

The lab environment consists of:

- Microsoft Azure subscription.
- Windows 10 virtual machine hosted in Azure.
- Azure Arc Connected Machine Agent.
- Azure Monitor Agent (AMA).
- Log Analytics Workspace.
- Microsoft Sentinel.

## Endpoint Configuration

The Windows 10 virtual machine was configured with Sysmon to capture detailed system activity, including process creation and other endpoint events.

## Security Monitoring

Microsoft Sentinel was enabled using the Log Analytics Workspace to support centralised security event monitoring and threat hunting.

Azure Monitor Agent and Data Collection Rules were configured to collect the required endpoint logs.

## Purpose

The environment provides the infrastructure required to perform practical threat hunting, analyse endpoint activity and investigate suspicious security events.
